612	     * backward-compatible). Its four-digit shape is already enforced by Bean Validation on the
613	     * request DTO. When the city maps to a known region (see {@link #REGION_POSTCODE_RANGES}) the
614	     * postcode must fall within that region's inclusive range; a city with no known region accepts
615	     * any 4-digit postcode.
